resource.description:
Optional JSON object specifying a resource or a subset of a resource. Supplying a value may may help to give an absolute answer instead of "maybe". It only applies when a policy relies on a resource or any of its parts to grant permission.

For example, the "Key owners" policy is granted for an applicable action when a key resource has the property meta.ownerId equal to that of the user. This is a sample of the JSON object to supply for the ReadKey action:
```
{
    "meta": {
        "ownerId": "local|f11157c8-9040-4793-9a1b-f2d410f4877b"
    }
}
```

